sb-junior-instructor-2024-answer-key/\">SarkariResult.com.cm</a></p>\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-303102a8\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-d96c68be\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-d96c68be\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-16a90584\">\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-22b2e02b gb-headline-text\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></h4>\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-3b2f0e17 gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Application Start Date <b>: 13 March 2024</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Application Last Date <b>: 11 April 2024</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date <strong>:</strong> <strong>11</strong><b> April 2024</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff;\">Exam Date </span></span>:<strong> 16-20 November 2024</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Admit Card Available : <strong>November 2024</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Answer Key Available : <span style=\"background-color: #ffff00;\"><strong>24 January 2025</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Result Available : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><b>Will Be Updated Here Soon.</b></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-fcbb81ff\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-fcbb81ff\">\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4ddaf9ee gb-headline-text\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></h4>\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-989f3ffd gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">General, OBC, EBC (CL) : <strong>\u20b9</strong><strong>\u00a0600/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">OBC, EBC, EWS, SC, ST of Rajasthan : <strong>\u20b9</strong><strong>\u00a0400/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"